{"id":140715076499489,"type":"artist","name":"Ocean Colour Scene","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":25,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Simon_Fowler_live.jpg?width=500","bio":"Sus comienzos no fueron fáciles, se fundaron en 1990 siguiendo la estela del \"revival\" mod de la época y cambiaron de compañía un par de veces, e incluso grabaron en tres ocasiones el mismo disco, hasta que quedaron contentos con el resultado. Así apareció su álbum debut \"Ocean Colour Scene\" en febreRo de 1992, con las aportaciones de la guitarra de Steve Cradock, el bajo de Damon Minchella, la batería de Oscar Harrison y la voz y las guitarras de Simon Fowler.","tags":["britpop","indie","rock","british","indie rock"]},"works":[{"id":183233413113557,"type":"album","name":"Ocean Colour Scene","artist":"Ocean Colour Scene","year":1992,"weight":3,"yt":"3lwX7pdhc7M","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":53161726480591,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Baggy","rank":48,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":44891237906834,"type":"album","name":"Moseley Shoals","artist":"Ocean Colour Scene","year":1996,"weight":19,"yt":"3lwX7pdhc7M","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":238350566072075,"name":"Pitchfork: The 50 Best Britpop Albums","rank":42,"scaruffi":null},{"id":122154202127653,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Mod Revival","rank":15,"scaruffi":null},{"id":209773919132126,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Mod","rank":26,"scaruffi":null},{"id":242302941379922,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Britpop","rank":47,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":4}},{"id":99596478541349,"type":"album","name":"Marchin' Already","artist":"Ocean Colour Scene","year":1997,"weight":7,"yt":"P-vJcwc6zd4","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":122154202127653,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Mod Revival","rank":7,"scaruffi":null},{"id":209773919132126,